<title>USA: Olympic Entertainment names president.</title>
<headline>Olympic Entertainment names president.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic Entertainment Group Inc on Wednesday named Chairman Dominic Orsatti to the additional role of president, effective July 1.</p>
<p>The company said Orsatti replaces Michael Marcovsky who is leaving to pursue personal investment opportunities.</p>
</text>
